OL,3,GGrampian                               
OL,5,CToday:FRain, with some hill snow in    
OL,6,Fthe west, will slowly clear this       
OL,7,Fmorning but may linger across the far  
OL,8,Feast until early afternoon. Otherwise  
OL,9,Fbecoming dry and bright but eastern    
OL,10,FAberdeenshire last to brighten up.     
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry with 
OL,13,Fsome frost and fog patches. Then it    
OL,14,Fwill stay dry for the rest of the      
OL,15,Fnight but clouding over across the     
OL,16,Feast.                                  
OL,18,CSaturday:FAfter a dry start it will be 
OL,19,Fa cloudy day with a chance of rain     
OL,20,Fspreading north in the afternoon, but  
OL,21,Fmore especially in the evening.        
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
